{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wudi-e-o031a","title":"濮阳交战与曹操火中脱身","accounts":[{"id":"wudi-e-o031a-account","label":"正文","text":"吕布攻鄄城不下而屯濮阳，曹操攻之失利，突火坠马伤手，楼异扶其上马脱身。","evidence":["wudi-e-o031a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0088","role":"交战","evidence":["wudi-e-o031a-q"]},{"person":"cao-cao","role":"受伤脱身","evidence":["wudi-e-o031a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0106","role":"扶马救援","evidence":["wudi-e-o031a-q"]}],"place":{"text":"鄄城、濮阳","evidence":["wudi-e-o031a-q"]},"time":{"label":"兴平元年","year":194,"precision":"year","basis":"纪年经本批逐段审定；年份依据见所引原文纪年与现代注释。","evidence":["wudi-e-o031a-q","wudi-q-o028","wudi-q-b-927979d68d5dacfd36fe"],"chronology":"wudi-y194","dating_review":{"anchor":"wudi-q-o028","basis":"兴平元年","reviewed":true}},"source_order":[1,219,"O031a"],"related_events":[{"event":"lizang-e2-wei018-072","type":"related","evidence":["lizang-q-bb884336a33be1bf00cf","lizang-q-bd7366d2281f7836b78b","lizang-q-38eebc2421c011f99859","lizang-q-d8009c7432ac1beb9ec1","wudi-e-o031a-q"]}],"order":100},{"id":"lizang-e2-wei018-072","title":"太祖讨吕布于濮阳，夜袭其别屯，比明破之","accounts":[{"id":"lizang-a-5881a081341fb6e3909f","label":"正文","text":"太祖讨吕布于濮阳，夜袭其别屯，比明破之","evidence":["lizang-q-bb884336a33be1bf00cf"]},{"id":"lizang-a-3f038fd18ef3952904d1","label":"正文","text":"未及还，布救兵至三面掉战，布身自搏战自旦至日昳相持急","evidence":["lizang-q-bd7366d2281f7836b78b"]},{"id":"lizang-a-75aa5751e8689a07417d","label":"正文","text":"太祖募陷阵，典韦先占，将应募者数十人重铠持长矛撩戟","evidence":["lizang-q-38eebc2421c011f99859"]},{"id":"lizang-a-54b9e0fa089b1a4d3ede","label":"正文","text":"西面急韦进当之，虏至乃持戟大呼起，所抵皆倒，布众退，会日暮太祖乃得引去","evidence":["lizang-q-d8009c7432ac1beb9ec1"]}],"participants":[{"person":"shaodi-p0012","role":"陷阵拒敌","evidence":["lizang-q-38eebc2421c011f99859","lizang-q-d8009c7432ac1beb9ec1"]},{"person":"cao-cao","role":"夜袭吕布别屯，遇援兵战后引去","evidence":["lizang-q-bb884336a33be1bf00cf","lizang-q-bd7366d2281f7836b78b","lizang-q-38eebc2421c011f99859","lizang-q-d8009c7432ac1beb9ec1"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"本篇独立行动，未继承范围不同的旧事件日期。","evidence":["lizang-q-bb884336a33be1bf00cf","lizang-q-bd7366d2281f7836b78b","lizang-q-38eebc2421c011f99859","lizang-q-d8009c7432ac1beb9ec1"]},"ordering_evidence":"lizang-q-bb884336a33be1bf00cf","related_events":[{"event":"wudi-e-o031a","type":"related","evidence":["lizang-q-bb884336a33be1bf00cf","lizang-q-bd7366d2281f7836b78b","lizang-q-38eebc2421c011f99859","lizang-q-d8009c7432ac1beb9ec1","wudi-e-o031a-q"]}],"order":3684}],"persons":[{"id":"cao-cao","name":"曹操","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0088","name":"吕布","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0106","name":"楼异","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"lizang-q-38eebc2421c011f99859","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-f63794d4a240c058fd7d","layer":"original","quote":"太祖募陷阵〖11〗，韦先占〖12〗；将应募者数（千）〔十〕人。皆重衣两铠，弃盾，但持长矛、撩戟","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":169,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":75,"end":122},{"id":"lizang-q-bb884336a33be1bf00cf","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-f63794d4a240c058fd7d","layer":"original","quote":"太祖讨吕布于濮阳。布有别屯，在濮阳西四五十里。太祖夜袭，比明破之","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":169,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":32},{"id":"lizang-q-bd7366d2281f7836b78b","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-f63794d4a240c058fd7d","layer":"original","quote":"未及还，会布救兵至，三面掉战〖9〗。时布身自搏战，自旦至日昳数十合〖10〗，相持急","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":169,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":33,"end":74},{"id":"lizang-q-d8009c7432ac1beb9ec1","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-f63794d4a240c058fd7d","layer":"original","quote":"时西面又急，韦进，当之；贼弓弩乱发，矢至如雨。韦不视，谓等人曰〖14〗：“虏来十步〖15〗，乃白之。”等人曰：“十步矣。”又曰：“五步乃白！”等人惧，疾言：“虏至矣！”韦手持十余戟，大呼起，所抵无不应手倒者，布众退。会日暮，太祖乃得引去","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":169,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":127,"end":245},{"id":"wudi-e-o031a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-876ab9be287bc4211eec","layer":"original","quote":"布到，攻鄄城不能下，西屯濮阳。太祖曰：“布一旦得一州〖3〗，不能据东平，断亢父、泰山之道乘险要我〖4〗；而乃屯濮阳：吾知其无能为也〖5〗。”遂进军攻之。布出兵战，先以骑犯青州兵〖6〗；青州兵奔，太祖阵乱。驰突火出，坠马，烧左手掌。司马楼异扶太祖上马〖7〗，遂引去。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":218,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":132},{"id":"wudi-q-b-927979d68d5dacfd36fe","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-927979d68d5dacfd36fe","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二年：兴平二年（公元 195）。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":246,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-8c38464987eb86819ded","start":0,"end":19},{"id":"wudi-q-o028","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-fefe0240b8480efce927","layer":"original","quote":"兴平元年春，太祖自徐州还〖1〗。初，太祖父嵩，去官后还谯。董卓之乱，避难琅邪〖2〗。为陶谦所害，故太祖志在复仇东伐。﹝一﹞","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":204,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":61}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
